[I] HTML, XML, SAX, and Reader parser for Ruby

[T] Nokogiri is an HTML, XML, SAX, and Reader parser for Ruby, with XPath
[T] and CSS selector support, here built against the system libxml2 and
[T] libxslt.

[U] https://nokogiri.org/

[A] Mike Dalessio, Aaron Patterson
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] CROSS

[E] add libxml libxslt mini-portile2

[L] MIT
